<title>▶ You can find chai and coffee almost everywhere. So why not protein?...</title>
<link>https://www.instagram.com/p/DgSK3w8g32m/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">instagram:https://www.instagram.com/p/DgSK3w8g32m/</guid>
<pubDate>Sat, 28 Nov 2026 11:45:57 GMT</pubDate>
<dc:creator>Only What’s Needed · Instagram</dc:creator>
<category>Instagram</category>
<media:content url="https://www.instagram.com/p/DgSK3w8g32m/media?size=l" medium="image"/>
<description><![CDATA[<video controls><source src="" poster="https://www.instagram.com/p/DgSK3w8g32m/media?size=l" type="video/mp4"><img src="https://www.instagram.com/p/DgSK3w8g32m/media?size=l" alt=""></video><br><br>You can find chai and coffee almost everywhere. So why not protein?<br />
<br />
When we started OWN, our vision was simple: make India protein sufficient. And for that to happen, protein needs to become a part of our everyday lives. <br />
<br />
That&rsquo;s exactly why I&rsquo;m so happy about our collaboration with @basil.healthofficial <br />
<br />
Together, we&rsquo;re bringing OWN protein smoothies to 70+ Basil outlets across Chandigarh, Delhi NCR and Bengaluru.<br />
<br />
For us, these partnerships are about more than just making OWN available at more places. They&rsquo;re about making protein more accessible, more convenient and eventually, a more natural part of what India eats every day.<br />
<br />
We&rsquo;re taking one small step at a time, but every step counts.<br />
<br />
One step closer to making India protein sufficient. ❤️]]></description>
</item>
