<description><![CDATA[<video controls><source src="" poster="https://www.instagram.com/p/DgPvrnWAD_l/media?size=l" type="video/mp4"><img src="https://www.instagram.com/p/DgPvrnWAD_l/media?size=l" alt=""></video><br><br>Why don&#039;t we do Black Friday sales?<br />
<br />
Festive Sale, Holiday Sale, BOGO, and many more! We&#039;re used to so many types of sales, but at Only What&#039;s Needed, we don&#039;t believe in doing any.<br />
<br />
We are not against brands or people who run these sales, it just doesn&#039;t align with our philosophy. <br />
<br />
At Only What&#039;s Needed, we want you to buy only what&#039;s needed. Not more than you need, not just because there&#039;s a discount, and definitely not because you&#039;re afraid of missing out. <br />
