<br />
The association between shakers and protein powders does make sense, especially for gym-goers, since shakers are easy to carry and make mixing whey convenient.<br />
<br />
But thinking that this is the only way to consume protein powder is where things go wrong.<br />
<br />
But wait, can you actually cook with protein powder? Tell us what you think in the comments below! 👇<br />
<br />
Stay tuned for the answer!]]></description>
